          }
        },
        "text_8WeYnR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-0",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-xl",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-sm",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-xl",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-xl",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "95ch",
            "richtext": "<h4>Why Choose the Blueair Classic Pro?</h4><p></p><p>With its Asthma and Allergy Friendly™ Certification, the Classic Pro is not just another air purifier. It’s a proven solution designed to reduce allergens and improve indoor air quality. By combining HINS Lighting Technology, HEPASilent™ filtration, and whisper-quiet operation, the Classic Pro is a trusted ally in creating a safer, more comfortable environment for you and your family.</p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
        "text_KgNxW6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-sm",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-sm",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-xxl",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-sm",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-xxl",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "95ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Some advanced features of the Classic Pro CP7i include:</p><ul><li>HINS Lighting Technology, which neutralizes germs trapped on filters using specialized light</li><li>5 layers of filtration, removing 99.97% of airborne pollutants like pollen, dust, and smoke with HEPASilent™ technology</li><li>Powerful performance, cleaning up to 2,800 ft² in just 1 hour, quietly transforming your air</li></ul><p></p><p>The Asthma and Allergy Friendly™ Certification sets a high bar for air purification products. By achieving this rigorous certification, Blueair’s Classic Pro Air Purifier has been proven to help improve air quality for those dealing with asthma and allergies. Don't fall for misleading claims—choose a product that you can trust. Breathe easier and enjoy a healthier home with Blueair today!</p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        }
      },
